---
title: Closed-Loop Control Sequence
config:
    theme: forest
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Teleop as Teleop Node
    participant Converter as Velocity Converter
    participant Plugin as Dynamic Model Plugin
    participant Driver as Motor Driver Node
    participant Motor as Physical Motor
    participant Odom as Odometry Publisher

    Note over User,Odom: Initialization Phase
    Converter->>Plugin: load_plugin("single_motor_model")
    Plugin->>Plugin: initialize(params)
    Driver->>Motor: Enable Motor (CIA402 FSM)
    Motor-->>Driver: State: OPERATION_ENABLED

    Note over User,Odom: Runtime Control Loop (10-100 Hz)
    User->>Teleop: Press ↑ (increase speed)
    Teleop->>Converter: /cmd_vel (linear.x = 0.5 m/s)
    
    Note over Converter,Plugin: Closed-Loop Computation
    Converter->>Driver: Request current feedback
    Driver-->>Converter: MotorFeedback (position, velocity, current)
    
    Converter->>Plugin: update(cmd_vel, feedback)
    Plugin->>Plugin: Compute error = target - actual
    Plugin->>Plugin: PID control calculation
    Plugin->>Plugin: Apply velocity/acceleration limits
    Plugin-->>Converter: MotorCommand (target_velocity_rad_s)
    
    Converter->>Driver: /motors/motor_1/command
    Driver->>Motor: Write RPDO1 (target_velocity)
    
    Note over Motor: Motor executes velocity profile
    Motor-->>Driver: TPDO1 (statusword, position)
    Motor-->>Driver: TPDO2 (velocity, current)
    
    Driver->>Converter: /motors/motor_1/feedback
    Driver->>Odom: /motors/motor_1/feedback
    
    Odom->>Odom: Integrate encoder velocity
    Odom->>Odom: Calculate pose (x, y, theta)
    Odom->>Teleop: /odom (nav_msgs/Odometry)
    Odom->>Teleop: /tf (odom → base_link)

    Note over User,Odom: User Stops Motion
    User->>Teleop: Press '0' (stop)
    Teleop->>Converter: /cmd_vel (linear.x = 0)
    Converter->>Plugin: update(zero_velocity, feedback)
    Plugin->>Plugin: Ramp down to zero
    Plugin-->>Converter: MotorCommand (0 rad/s)
    Converter->>Driver: /motors/motor_1/command
    Driver->>Motor: Write RPDO1 (velocity = 0)
    Motor-->>Driver: Motor decelerates to stop

    Note over User,Odom: Shutdown Sequence
    User->>Teleop: Press ESC (exit)
    Teleop->>Converter: Shutdown signal
    Converter->>Plugin: shutdown()
    Plugin-->>Converter: Safe stop command
    Converter->>Driver: Stop command (velocity = 0)
    Converter->>Driver: Service: reset_fault (if needed)
    Driver->>Motor: Disable Operation (CIA402 FSM)
    Motor-->>Driver: State: SWITCH_ON_DISABLED
    Teleop->>Teleop: Exit gracefully
